    <item>
      <title>美加关税谈判如何演变为全面贸易战</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/25/world/canada/trump-carney-trade-war-tariffs.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[谈判最后几个小时的详细记录显示，虽然美国向加拿大提供了它所说的所有国家中最好的协议，但加拿大必须放弃的东西却被认为是不可想象的。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/25/world/canada/trump-carney-trade-war-tariffs.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 05:12:26 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>特朗普政府旨在吊销申请庇护的外国公民的签证</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/24/us/politics/trump-administration-aims-to-revoke-visas-of-foreign-citizens-applying-for-asylum.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[美国国务院已开始审查，此举可能会影响多达 20 万签证持有者和庇护申请人。取消可能会一波又一波地发生。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/24/us/politics/trump-administration-aims-to-revoke-visas-of-foreign-citizens-applying-for-asylum.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 03:37:32 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>特朗普扼杀伊朗经济的企图取决于中国的合作</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/24/us/politics/trump-bessent-iran-economic-d-day.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[20年来，美国一直承诺对伊朗实施“严厉制裁”。但在军事行动未能实现特朗普总统的目标之后，最新的努力出现了逆转。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/24/us/politics/trump-bessent-iran-economic-d-day.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 01:10:23 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>特朗普在南卡罗来纳州决选前为达林·格雷厄姆（Darline Graham）下了赌注</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/24/us/politics/trump-graham-south-carolina-endorsement.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[总统在南卡罗来纳州参议员竞选中支持林赛·格雷厄姆的妹妹，并向盟友施压以支持她。由他的顾问管理的超级政治行动委员会已为她的竞选花费了近 80 万美元。够了吗？]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/24/us/politics/trump-graham-south-carolina-endorsement.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 00:43:23 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>美国关税可能会使加拿大公司离开美国并威胁数千个就业机会</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/24/world/canada/us-tariffs-trade-economy.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[经济学家表示，特朗普总统对加拿大输美产品征收50%的关税，将使许多加拿大公司无法继续向美国市场销售产品。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/24/world/canada/us-tariffs-trade-economy.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 00:33:34 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>最高法院暂时允许特朗普实行邮寄投票限制</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/24/us/politics/supreme-court-trump-mail-ballots.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[政府要求法院为特朗普总统的命令扫清道路，该命令创建“州公民名单”并指示邮政服务决定谁获得邮寄选票。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/24/us/politics/supreme-court-trump-mail-ballots.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 00:09:09 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>特朗普官员提议对技术工人签证收取超过10万美元的费用</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/24/us/politics/h1b-visas-fees-proposal-trump.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[该提议是在特朗普政府去年试图对 H-1B 签证附加类似费用时遇到法律挑战之后提出的。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/24/us/politics/h1b-visas-fees-proposal-trump.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Tue, 25 Aug 2026 00:03:11 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>特朗普悄悄寻求对邮政服务的控制，以改变美国选举</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/24/us/politics/mail-voting-supreme-court-postal-service-trump.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[周一，最高法院允许邮寄投票限制的准备工作继续进行，这一努力得到了新的关注。法官们表示，这并不是对该命令合法性的最终裁决。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/24/us/politics/mail-voting-supreme-court-postal-service-trump.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 23:09:01 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>美国公布了削弱伊朗经济的行动，但几乎没有提供任何细节</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/24/us/politics/bessent-treasury-assault-iran-economy.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[财政部长斯科特·贝森特承认，这一努力更多的是一次警告，将开始一段“静默外交”时期。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/24/us/politics/bessent-treasury-assault-iran-economy.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 22:26:44 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>伊朗承诺反抗特朗普的经济制裁</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/24/world/middleeast/iran-sanctions-economy-us-trump.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[分析人士表示，在美国宣布采取新措施挤压伊朗经济后，德黑兰可能会在军事上加剧争端。  一名伊朗官员发誓，“一滴石油”都不会离开海湾。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/08/24/world/middleeast/iran-sanctions-economy-us-trump.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 24 Aug 2026 21:12:01 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
